# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only what the published site loads.
# Raw data (south_west/, general_map/), build tools (tools/), parked pages
# (_parked/), .DS_Store and editor config all stay local.
*

!.gitignore

# Pages and styles
!index.html
!publications.html
!cv.html
!walking.html
!style.css

# Assets the pages load
!images/
!images/profile.jpg
!data/
!data/swcp.js
